@startuml DATAFLOW
!theme plain
autonumber

actor "User / Client" as User
participant "API Gateway / App" as App
database "Database / State" as DB
participant "External Services" as Ext

User -> App : 1. Action / Request
activate App

App -> DB : 2. Query / Validate Constraints
activate DB
DB --> App : 3. Current State
deactivate DB

App -> Ext : 4. External Sync / Process (if applicable)
activate Ext
Ext --> App : 5. Response / Result
deactivate Ext

App -> DB : 6. Persist Transition / Audit Log
activate DB
DB --> App : 7. Acknowledged
deactivate DB

App --> User : 8. Response / View Update
deactivate App

@enduml
